<title>MEXICO: PYP 6-month net loss increases.</title>
<headline>PYP 6-month net loss increases.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>6-mo 1997		   6-mo 1996</p>
<p>	Net  loss	  8.351  million  loss     5.210  million</p>
<p>	Oper loss	  13.09  million  loss	3.07  million</p>
<p>	Revs		 18.26  million	     27.72  million</p>
<p>	Integ fin gain    4.94   million  gain     2.00  million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>Full company name is PYP SA.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9559))</p>
